@startuml RF15_Sequencia
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam titleFontSize 15
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam ArrowColor #52606D
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDEB
  BorderColor #D8CE78
  FontColor #554F24
}
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
  ActorBorderColor #4A4852
  GroupBorderColor #CBC6BE
  GroupBackgroundColor #FAF8F5
}
autonumber "<b>0."
title RF15 — Editar uma fotografia de uma peça de roupa (adição de peça ou novo esquema) através de um Editor Canvas Interativo 2D\nDiagrama de sequência — gerado do código em 2026-10-06 (scripts/diagramas/v5)

actor "Pessoa usuária" as U
boundary "Tela /photos" as P
control "PhotoController" as PhotoController
participant "PhotoService" as PhotoService
database "MySQL" as DB_MySQL
participant "Guard" as Guard
participant "WardrobeService" as WardrobeService
participant "MediaService" as MediaService
== RF12.CA02 / RF15.CA02 — Salvar a edição do Editor Canvas 2D (a origin… ==
U -> P : RF12.CA02 / RF15.CA02 — Salvar a edição do Editor…
P -> PhotoController : POST /api/photos/{id}/edits
PhotoController -> PhotoService : saveEdit()
activate PhotoService
PhotoService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT photos
PhotoService -> Guard : requireOwner()
PhotoService -> Guard : requireCanCreate()
PhotoService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT wardrobe_items
PhotoService -> WardrobeService : replaceImage()
WardrobeService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT wardrobe_items
WardrobeService -> DB_MySQL : SELECT reactions
WardrobeService --> PhotoService
PhotoService -> MediaService : put() (×2)
PhotoService -> MediaService : register()
MediaService -> DB_MySQL : INSERT/UPDATE photos
MediaService --> PhotoService
deactivate PhotoService
PhotoService --> PhotoController : resultado
PhotoController --> P : 201 JSON
P --> U : atualiza a tela
== Remoção de fundo sob demanda para o editor ==
U -> P : Remoção de fundo sob demanda para o editor
P -> PhotoController : POST /api/photos/background-removal
PhotoController -> PhotoService : removeBackground()
activate PhotoService
PhotoService -> Guard : requireCanCreate()
PhotoService -> WardrobeService : governedFlatLay()
deactivate PhotoService
PhotoService --> PhotoController : resultado
PhotoController --> P : 201 JSON
P --> U : atualiza a tela
@enduml
